      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>One of your knuckles is skinned as a shot ricochets off it, causing your fingers to spasm.</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> Pass an <strong>Average (+20) Endurance</strong> Test to avoid dropping anything held in that hand. If the item was held in both hands you may reroll once.</p>"
